Lens calibration database
==========================

The XML files in this directory (assets/lens-database/) are the lens
calibration database from the Lensfun project:

    https://github.com/lensfun/lensfun

Source: data/db/ directory of the lensfun/lensfun repository (branch
"master"), downloaded 2026-08-14.

